{
 "name": "Travel Deal Hunter — Siva",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "CREDENTIALS NEEDED (pick/create on import — no credential is set in this file):\nn8n shows \"No credential set\" on each node below; click the node and pick/create the credential. No key or secret is stored in this file.\n- Google Sheets account (googleSheetsOAuth2) — Read Travel Watchlist, Save Draft Itinerary, Check Approval Sheet, Log Awaiting Approval, Log Execution, Log Error to Sheet\n- Google Calendar account (googleCalendarOAuth2) — Read Calendar Gaps\n- Kiwi Tequila API (httpHeaderAuth) — Fetch Flight Prices, Fetch Hotel Prices\n- Google Gemini(PaLM) Api (googlePalmApi) — Gemini Chat Model\n- Telegram account (telegramApi) — Send Deal Alert via Telegram, Notify — Ready to Book (Manual), Notify Error via Telegram",
    "height": 242,
    "width": 560,
    "color": 4
   },
   "id": "580cd12f-dbf6-4379-9a88-65d0a8043b95",
   "name": "Sticky Note — Credentials",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    0,
    -522
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "Travel Deal Hunter — Siva\nEvery 6h read trip watchlist from Sheets, check flight + hotel prices, alert on drops via Telegram. Gemini drafts an itinerary from preferences + Google Calendar gaps.\nHUMAN APPROVAL before any booking — this workflow never books anything.",
    "height": 140,
    "width": 560,
    "color": 4
   },
   "id": "7741ca4a-81f7-4073-9271-5722ffd3b0ae",
   "name": "About This Workflow",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    0,
    -260
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "rule": {
     "interval": [
      {
       "field": "hours",
       "hoursInterval": 6
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   "id": "aa3a765b-f0fe-4608-b4c0-bf2f4674951c",
   "name": "Every 6 hours",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    0,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "documentId": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
    "sheetName": "Travel Watchlist",
    "operation": "read"
   },
   "id": "821c30f5-0824-407e-a757-a75e4012f415",
   "name": "Read Travel Watchlist",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
   "typeVersion": 4,
   "position": [
    240,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "resource": "event",
    "operation": "getAll",
    "calendarId": "primary",
    "returnAll": true
   },
   "id": "ed87c16e-2f21-441d-a3e8-906e8013af4e",
   "name": "Read Calendar Gaps",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    480,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "method": "GET",
    "url": "https://api.tequila.kiwi.com/v2/search?fly_from=YOUR_HOME_AIRPORT&fly_to=YOUR_DESTINATION&date_from=YOUR_DATE_FROM&date_to=YOUR_DATE_TO&curr=INR&limit=5",
    "authentication": "none",
    "options": {
     "response": {
      "response": {
       "responseFormat": "json"
      }
     },
     "timeout": 10000
    }
   },
   "id": "e51f8048-c89b-4fd9-8655-f164f0e2b845",
   "name": "Fetch Flight Prices",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.2,
   "position": [
    720,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "method": "GET",
    "url": "https://api.tequila.kiwi.com/v2/search?fly_from=YOUR_HOME_AIRPORT&fly_to=YOUR_DESTINATION&date_from=YOUR_DATE_FROM&date_to=YOUR_DATE_TO&curr=INR&limit=5",
    "authentication": "none",
    "options": {
     "response": {
      "response": {
       "responseFormat": "json"
      }
     },
     "timeout": 10000
    }
   },
   "id": "6fc16c9d-7f84-4fda-864a-7909d7c1b9c3",
   "name": "Fetch Hotel Prices",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.2,
   "position": [
    960,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "mode": "append"
   },
   "id": "fbcf90a8-257a-4e73-b974-a4433a479c92",
   "name": "Merge Prices",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
   "typeVersion": 3,
   "position": [
    1200,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "// Compare fetched price with the target_price / last_seen_price from the watchlist row.\n// Keeps only rows where price dropped below target. Fill target_price in Sheets first.\nreturn $input.all().filter(i => { const p = Number(i.json.price ?? i.json.total ?? Infinity); const t = Number(i.json.target_price ?? Infinity); i.json.price_drop = p < t; return p < t; });"
   },
   "id": "f33c1bce-d47b-4e1b-a566-5fd7d20384b8",
   "name": "Detect Price Drop",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    1440,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "promptType": "text",
    "text": "=Using the trip in the input, the traveller preferences (budget, pace, interests from the watchlist row) and the free gaps from Google Calendar, draft a day-by-day itinerary. Keep it a DRAFT only, note total estimated cost in INR, and end with: 'Draft only — no booking made. Reply APPROVE in the approval sheet to proceed.' Input: {{ JSON.stringify($json).slice(0, 4000) }}",
    "options": {}
   },
   "id": "babbd2d8-5ace-4e99-ac81-c16d2325a6ae",
   "name": "Itinerary Drafter",
   "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
   "typeVersion": 1.7,
   "position": [
    1680,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "model": "gemini-2.0-flash",
    "options": {
     "temperature": 0.3
    }
   },
   "id": "6970945a-7bfe-433d-9c88-2561056dddb3",
   "name": "Gemini Chat Model",
   "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    1680,
    280
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "documentId": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
    "sheetName": "Draft Itineraries",
    "operation": "append",
    "columns": {
     "mappingMode": "manual",
     "value": {
      "timestamp": "={{ $now }}",
      "destination": "={{ $json.destination || '' }}",
      "itinerary": "={{ $json.output || '' }}",
      "status": "draft — awaiting approval"
     }
    }
   },
   "id": "f638b81c-3be0-4f88-a305-5d62ac393e0b",
   "name": "Save Draft Itinerary",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
   "typeVersion": 4,
   "position": [
    1920,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "chatId": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
    "text": "=✈️ Travel deal drop!\n\n{{ $json.output || JSON.stringify($json).slice(0, 800) }}\n\nDraft itinerary saved to the Draft Itineraries tab. Nothing is booked — approve in the Approval tab to proceed.",
    "additionalFields": {
     "appendAttribution": false
    }
   },
   "id": "84572778-209d-43d7-9cba-8dffc17c2b89",
   "name": "Send Deal Alert via Telegram",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    2160,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "documentId": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
    "sheetName": "Approval",
    "operation": "read"
   },
   "id": "5fc4545e-caff-4813-8cf3-2daadb2a42cb",
   "name": "Check Approval Sheet",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
   "typeVersion": 4,
   "position": [
    2400,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "conditions": {
     "options": {
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "leftValue": "",
      "typeValidation": "loose"
     },
     "conditions": [
      {
       "id": "b9923015-83dc-4c47-b2d2-b0334b9f62aa",
       "leftValue": "={{ $json.approval || '' }}",
       "rightValue": "APPROVE",
       "operator": {
        "type": "string",
        "operation": "equals"
       }
      }
     ],
     "combinator": "and"
    }
   },
   "id": "4c3f53f2-d229-43e6-b6bb-cce3737f371a",
   "name": "Approved to Book?",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
   "typeVersion": 2.2,
   "position": [
    2640,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "chatId": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
    "text": "=✅ Approved. You may now book this trip yourself — this workflow never books automatically. Destination and draft are in the Draft Itineraries tab.",
    "additionalFields": {
     "appendAttribution": false
    }
   },
   "id": "b5c9146d-33da-47e2-826a-d2e39ec3d8b1",
   "name": "Notify — Ready to Book (Manual)",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    2880,
    0
   ]
  },
